{
  "id": "LUK.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 20",
  "verseCount": 46,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geanyaash Yesu heeda nyasa gheambalmeadaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha nea ghoanaal buuneeda aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETEAN, nea gwarukwiida giijaasta miy, gaweay headaanyi ashoohoodiga hees ea ng'oorshoodiga ea gweargwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geeyeesha niny, “Rukuneasa gisini ng'asheesu aba gheambalmeedeabeang'a, ea ng'eaha gil siida goonyi gheambalmeani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha saawa nea gwayeesha, “Eara aniini gaydaanyaasheagwa ng'asheanjagi, asi arukunean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi giibaatiisanda Yohana gwaleabu humng'eeda ghana leabu heeda buuneeda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiissa gwasheang'nyi nea gwayi, “Ghamneawa iisiyeeshi, ‘Gwaleabu humng'eeda,’ gaygwayi, ‘Ghwasaan anda ghayi ak ea moamwasi niny?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama siyeeshi, ‘Gwaleabu heeda buuneeda,’ ada gaygafuteasa buuneesean aba lagheanga aba gideaba ghamwas sean gideaba Yohana sibaneeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha Saawa nea gwayeesha aseasa meanali heeleabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu saawa, “Eara aniini ea maydarukuneegwa heeda leabu giimbaliischooni iteanyu easini ng'asheesuun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gida sigala fuga aragan madamnyeanda sabiibu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoang'eat giibaloolda buuneeda nea gwarukusa galeesu, “Ghayi sih gang'eapsa sabiibu jeeda madamnyeandaanyi, hean gwanung'usa madamnyeandaanyi fuga jea gooragan, ak gawa darooraka sheagi, goobiida hoowa ea gageawiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goodeendeen ama gul damandida, goojeakta soomjeanda heeda fuga aragan madamnyeandean eataw haghweega mwaatkwa bea sabiibu; ng'ata ghabwar fugiga aragan madamnyeandean ak geanung' gawa nea mwaada gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu goojeakta siidida soomjeanda nuut; hita earada geabwar ea eesawan ak geenung' gawa nea ghabwaspwasaada nea mwaada gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu goojeakta siideaba samwagu; ada geabwar ea gwasawana ak geahoan gawa jarooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi siidida bea madamnyeanda misabiibuun, ‘Gay dasin naaha? Gaydeajeakta orjeedeanyu aabwariinyi; gwadeepa eesisa mureeda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah fugiga aragan madamnyeandean, gwayeesha geat saawa, ‘Siisi dea jea gwahearaniischi, anung' eabwara ghami ak gabwaaheasa hearaniischooda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geang'waay orjeedida bea siidean ak geeruuteawa jeeda madamnyeanda sabiibu ak geenuus. Asi heapi siisi bea madamnyeandean iihidu gaygwahindaan fiisu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adaaha gayghoan ama hidu gaygwanuuseada fugiga aragan madamnyeandanyiin ama hit gaygagasa fih suuk jea gwanung'usa madamnyeandaanyi.” Siyiiy ng'asheesu geeyi, “Gagasa ghoashiiy ASEETA!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoaduup ghaang' saawa, ak gwayeesha, “Abeeda ng'asheesu sing'waardunu naaha bea gideaba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giinyeashteayda giruteayda gwaadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gagasa ng'oorshoodiga ea ashoohoodiga hees gichea ghoang'waayda aba damandida, ak ghoawal buuneeda; aba gideaba saawa nijeeng'u gideaba ng'asheesu sigala geadiin geerukuna badahuuka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa geasaach niny nea geegasa gheata miy ak geecheakta fuga hinda geat fuga doobiiweadi, eanyas gheata gichea eaghasta aba ng'asheesu ikaaschiin, ak geayiin geatinga sugoocheanda haw ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geanyaash niny nea geeyeesha, “Giinealshoocheanda, geanali gideaba giruku ng'asheega nea giidoabiiwi, nea miduupi siisi haw, ang'iing'i giinaali buuneeda naweeda ASEETA doabiiwaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi, ghwadoabiiwi gideaba geataw Gaysari gwaadi, ghana manda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwajeeng'u milmilanda nyaawa ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oahiimnaan shiliingajeanda. Uhuuni ea gheawung'su gabeang'a?” Geeyeesha, “Gaba Gaysari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha saawa, “Asaha ghoatawji Gaysari gea Gaysari, ak ghoatawji ASEETA gea was gea ASEETA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gearaay gichea eang'waayda aba ng'asheagaaschi aba madeeda buuneeda; ghahamng'eanyi buuneeda aba gida shaayda ng'asheega ak ghwasiinda sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giinyaashteayda duunooda miyeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghapka headaanyi fiisu ng'ay was Sadukayajeega eena manda duunooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geanyaash nea geeyeesha, “Giinealshoocheanda, Musa ghayi gang'oorneasa gideaba siida iimea orjeeda ghaamwat, nea gwandeawa gatmooda mandeawana diibiga, gaygageanda orjeeda ghaamwat gatmoodida ak gwanyaksa diibiga orjeeda ghaamwat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi gwanda orju ispwa bea ghaamwadagi, gageeshi orjeeda haw, amadu ghami nea ghwanung'wa hiji gatmooda mandeawana diibiga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea deaba iyeenya ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gea deaba samwagu, iidu gwahearan orjoogiga seaniin asispwaan nea gameewa agi ea goosha sean nea gatmoodida ea mandeawana diibiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu eara gatmoodida ghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi eaweeda siituuna buuneeda gatmooni gaygaba ng'eaha? Aba gideaba nighi buuneeda ea ghwahita ispwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu saawa, “Orjoogeaba ng'eanyiini gageeshachi, nea geegeena; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea fugiga sinung' ghoah gili miisa ng'eanyiita bea hooweaniin nea duunoodida bea miyeedean mageeshachi nea meegeena, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea maygabiikta gameewa aba gideaba gaygawuurji malaykajeega, ak saawa ea orjooga ASEETA gil ea gideaba saawa orjooga siituutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba iita gideaba gwaduutu buuneeda, eara Musa ghoahiimu aba jeeda ng'ooruutka iita geeta mughuush damanda guursiina Ng'utamiida was ASEETA Abrahamu ea ASEETA Isaka ea ASEETA Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa niny mii ASEETA fuga nimeewa gil, aba gideaba ghwanyas sean eaweega aba niny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
